Looking at this problem, I need to find all $f: \mathbb{N} \to \mathbb{N}$ such that whenever $a_0 + a_1 x + \cdots + a_n x^n$ (with positive integer coefficients) has an integer root, so does $f(a_0) + f(a_1)x + \cdots + f(a_n)x^n$.

